# Adopted outside skills, one per line. Read by bin/install-skill-packs.sh.
# Columns (whitespace separated):
#   source   GitHub owner/repo
#   commit   full commit hash the copy is pinned to
#   pinned   date the pin was chosen (YYYY-MM-DD)
#   licence  path of the licence file in the repo, or declared:<name> when the repo
#            ships no licence file and declares one in its README or frontmatter
#   path     the skill folder inside the repo (. for a repo that is one skill)
#   name     folder name under pack/skills; must equal the SKILL.md name field
#   flags    comma list: note (add the harness note at the top of SKILL.md),
#            local (copy from the installed Claude Code plugin when present); or -
# Survey and reasons: docs/briefs/skill-packs.md. Conflicts: pack/skills/SOURCES.md.

# Karpathy behaviour guidelines: always on. Installed as a Claude Code plugin; copied from there.
forrestchang/andrej-karpathy-skills 2c606141936f1eeef17fa3043a72095b4765b9c2 2026-09-25 declared:MIT skills/karpathy-guidelines karpathy-guidelines local

